---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Essential Apps & Resources for Burgas - Eurovision 2027">
	<main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-4xl">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-black uppercase text-gray-900 mb-6">Burgas Survival Guide: Essential Apps & Resources</h1>
		<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12">
			Navigating a new city during a massive event like Eurovision requires the right tools. From public transport to ordering a taxi or paying road tolls, here are the essential apps you need to download before arriving in Bulgaria.
		</p>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
			<!-- Transport Apps -->
			<div class="bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🚍 Public Transport</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
					<li><strong>Moovit:</strong> The most reliable app for Burgas bus routes, schedules, and live tracking. A must-have for getting to Arena Burgas.</li>
					<li><strong>Transport Burgas:</strong> The official municipal app (sometimes spotty, but good for official route maps and purchasing digital tickets).</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Taxi Apps -->
			<div class="bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🚕 Taxis & Ride Hailing</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
					<li><strong>Maxim / TaxiMe:</strong> Uber is NOT available in Bulgaria. These are the closest local equivalents for ordering reliable, metered taxis without getting scammed.</li>
					<li><strong>Omega Taxi:</strong> One of the most reputable local taxi companies in Burgas with their own ordering app.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Driving -->
			<div class="bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🚗 Driving & Vignettes</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
					<li><strong>BGTOLL (bgtoll.bg):</strong> If you rent a car or drive into Bulgaria, you MUST buy an electronic vignette. Do it officially via this site/app to avoid massive fines.</li>
					<li><strong>Burgas Parking:</strong> For paying the "Blue Zone" and "Green Zone" street parking fees via SMS or card.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Food & Delivery -->
			<div class="bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🍕 Food Delivery</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
					<li><strong>Takeaway.com:</strong> The biggest food delivery network in Burgas.</li>
					<li><strong>Glovo:</strong> Excellent for fast food, groceries, and pharmacy deliveries straight to your hotel or Airbnb.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Newsletter Lead Magnet -->
		<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-purple-600 rounded-3xl p-10 text-white shadow-2xl text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase mb-4">Want the Full PDF Survival Guide?</h2>
			<p class="text-lg mb-8 opacity-90 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
				We are preparing a massive, printable 20-page **Burgas 2027 Eurovision Survival Guide** (including offline maps, emergency numbers, and insider local tips). Drop your email below and we'll send it to you as soon as it's published!
			</p>
			<form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center max-w-lg mx-auto">
				<input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" class="px-6 py-4 rounded-full text-gray-900 w-full focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-pink-300" required>
				<button type="submit" class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition transform hover:scale-105 whitespace-nowrap">
					Send Me The Guide
				</button>
			</form>
			<p class="text-sm mt-4 opacity-75">No spam. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
		</div>

	</main>
</Layout>
